      <h>135</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>ChocAn - Project 4 | Team 37 | Final implementation
All 19 application types are shown. Fields and selected public operations match src/chocan.
Constructors, routine accessors, private helpers, and standard Java-library types are omitted.
Solid arrows: stored references. Dotted arrows: uses/creates. 0..*: collection elements. No inheritance is used.
Main constructs and wires the shared objects. Validation supplies static checks to managers, Service, and ReportGenerator.
MemberManager/ProviderManager share the same Member/Provider lists held by DataStore; these are not separate stores.</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
